<p>When a single blow deals more than 15% of your total life, a torrent of blood gushes from your body, creating a bloody tidal wave for 4 turns that deals <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Constitution 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">130, 175, 250, 325, 400</acronym> blight damage, heals you for 50% of the damage done, and knocks foes back.</p><p>The damage increases with your Constitution.</p>